x_anis_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_13","text":"I'll have them replenished.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_14","text":"Woo-hoo!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_15","text":"That's our Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_16","text":"You're quick!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_17","text":"Anything else?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_18","text":"What else?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_19","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_20","text":"I just need to tell you what we need?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_21","text":"In that case, can you get us","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_22","text":"some fruit-flavored soda this time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_23","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_23","text":"How about lemon?","jump":"m_ex_anis_02_25"},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_24","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_24","text":"How about lime?","jump":"m_ex_anis_02_25"},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_25","text":"Sounds good.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_26","text":"I don't really care what flavor it is,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_27","text":"get whatever you want!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_28","text":"Okay","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_29","text":"Hey, what's going on?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_30","text":"Did you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_31","text":"do something wrong, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_32","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_33","text":"Why are you being so nice all of a sudden?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_34","text":"I've always been nice.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_35","text":"That's true, but","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_36","text":"Idk... you seem much nicer to me than you usually do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_37","text":"Would you rather I'm not?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_38","text":"No,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_39","text":"I didn't say that...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_40","text":"Then...??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_41","text":"Hahahaha","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_42","text":"It's nothing! Anyway, thanks, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_anis_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_anis_02_43","text":"Sure...","jump":null}],"chat":true}